    "text_full": "Product Services Resources Case Studies Pricing Contact Us\nLogin Get Started\nDiscover What's New\nWe continually release new features and updates that improve the FYI platform and boost your practice’s productivity.\nKeep visiting to find out about our latest and greatest time-saving features and automations.\n Released 07 May 2026\nAnnouncing the integration with Annature Identity Verification\n\nFYI is excited to announce the Annature integration with FYI has been extended to support Annature’s new Identity Verification feature.\n\nWhat does this mean for FYI users?\n\nIdentity Verification enhances the Annature integration by Sending verification requests, Automatically sync verification details, Optional Import of Certificate of Verification, Create disbursements automatically\n\nWho is this available for?\n\nIdentity Verification is available now to all practices using the Annature integration.\n\nLearn More\n Released 30 April 2026\nFYI product Update | April 2026\nNew Integration: Zato\nMore improvements to Email AutoFile Activity\nEnhanced Client and Job synchronisation for XPM practices\nBulk Update Time Types for Elite practices\nLearn More\n Released 21 April 2026\nAnnouncing the new Integration with Zato (Australia and New Zealand only)\n\nFYI excited to announce a new integration with Zato, a SaaS platform for Chartered Accounting practices in Australia and New Zealand that automates key accounting workflows, including workpapers, journals, and reconciliations.\n\nWhat does this mean for FYI users?\nThe integration with Zato offers the following benefits: Workflow Efficiency, Compliance and Audit Readiness and Single source of truth.\n\nWho is this available for?\nZato integration is available now to all users on the Pro and Elite plans, for practices in Australia and New Zealand.\n\n \n\nLearn More\n Released 01 April 2026\nFYI Product Update | March 2026\nNew Integration: Cradle, GovReports and Waive\nEnhanced Email AutoFile Activity\nImproved Custom Field synchronisation for XPM Practice\nNew Permissions for Elite practices\nLearn More\n Released 30 March 2026\nAnnouncing the release of Convert Excel Reports to Templates\n\nFYI is excited to announce that the Convert Excel Reports to Templates feature is now available for all practices on the Elite plan.\n\nWhat does this mean for FYI users?\n\nInstead of recreating report templates or maintaining multiple versions, FYI Admins or users with Templates permission can convert reports into reusable templates and apply them consistently. This allows users to Convert Reports from the Documents List, Create New or Update Existing Templates and Retain report structure while removing data.\n\nWho is this available for?\n\nConvert Excel Reports to Templates is available now to all practices on the Elite plan.\n\nLearn More\n Released 27 March 2026\nAnnouncing the new Integration with Cradle\n\nFYI is excited to announce a new integration with Cradle, a cloud-based phone system, replacing traditional desk phones and phone services to allow users to make and receive calls from anywhere.\n\nWhat does this mean for FYI users?\n\nThe integration with Cradle offers the following benefits: Automatic client matching, Phone Call Records created and filed automatically, Call transcriptions captured, Source tracking for automation and Centralised communication history.\n\nWho is this available for?\n\nThe Integration with Cradle is available now to all users on the Pro and Elite plans.\n\nLearn More\n Released 26 March 2026\nAnnouncing the Integration with Waive (Australia only)\n\nFYI is excited to announce a new integration with Waive, enabling practices to automatically synchronise ASIC-related documents directly into FYI, ensuring important compliance records are consistently filed.\n\nWhat does this mean for FYI users?\n\nThe integration with Waive offers the following benefits: Company Sync, Preferred Cabinet Filing and Document Synchronisation.\n\nWho is this available for?\n\nThe Waive integration is available to practices in Australia on the Pro or Elite plans.\n\nLearn More\n Released 25 March 2026\nAnnouncing the Integration with GovReports (Australia only)\n\nFYI is excited to announce that the GovReports integration is now available for all practices in Australia. GovReports enables practices to manage tax lodgements and compliance, with documents synchronised directly into FYI.\n\nWhat does this mean for FYI users?\n\nConnecting GovReports to FYI allows practices to seamlessly manage tax and compliance workflows, ensuring documents and lodgement records are filed within FYI. Allowing to Bulk import of clients, file tax returns, real-time document status updates and improved workflow efficiency.\n\nWho is this available for?\n\nThe GovReports integration is available to practices in Australia on Pro or Elite plans.\n\nLearn More\n Released 09 March 2026\nFYI AI Feature Rollout: What it means for your Practice\n\nFYI is thrilled to announce FYI AI, where the power of generative AI meets our Automation engine to supercharge your workflows and productivity. FYI AI brings cutting-edge AI models to automations, enabling smarter workflows, quicker responses and deeper insights to your practice.\n\nWhat does this mean for FYI users?\n\nWith the release of FYI AI, practices can begin to use the following features: Automatic Email Draft Replies, Delegate Tasks, Automatic Document Filing, Document summarisation, Web Search, Meeting Summary and Tasks. \n\nWho is this available for?\n\nFYI AI is available at no additional cost to practices on the Elite plan. Pricing details for practices on the Pro plan will be shared closer to the General release.\n\nLearn More\n Released 28 February 2026\nFYI Product Update | February 2026\nNew forms feature for Elite users \nNew optimised Job Sync for XPM practices\nEnhanced Automation step including look up job, Look Up Client and Create Task\nImproved synchronisation for APS, CCH, IRIS and MYOB practices\nLearn More\n1 2 3 … 14\nAustralia \n \nProduct\nProven ROI\nSecurity and Reliability\nIntegrations\nPricing\nSolutions\nManage your Documents\nManage your Work\nAutomate your Processes\nFeatures\nEmails\nDocuments\nSearch and Retrieval\nClient Management\nTasks & Comments\nJob Management\nCollaborate\nWorkflows\nProcess Automation\nTime & Billing\nReporting\nEmployee Management\nForms\nServices\nOnboarding\nMigration\nConsulting\nSupport\nCompany\nAbout Us\nCareers\nContact Us\nResources\nAutomation Library\nCustomer Stories\nEvents\nWhat’s New\nBlog\nFAQs\nService Status\nGet Support\nHelp Centre\nFYI User Community\n© FYI Software 2026\nTerms & Conditions Security Cookie Policy"
